WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.970
♪♪

00:00:03.970 --> 00:00:07.407
♪ Blow Your Mind ♪

00:00:07.407 --> 00:00:08.808
-Questlove!

00:00:08.808 --> 00:00:10.977
Do you want to explain
how the game works?

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:15.848
-Of course, Jimmy.

00:00:15.848 --> 00:00:17.917
In this game,
I will read each of you

00:00:17.917 --> 00:00:20.519
a mind-blowing fact.

00:00:20.519 --> 00:00:25.224
And you must decide
if that fact is true or false.

00:00:25.224 --> 00:00:27.694
If you choose wrong,

00:00:27.694 --> 00:00:31.564
we will blow your mind.

00:00:32.999 --> 00:00:34.800
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.937
You will be blasted in the face
from the tube in front of you.

00:00:38.937 --> 00:00:40.373
Make the right choice,

00:00:40.373 --> 00:00:43.443
and your opponent
gets their mind blown.

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:46.246
-Okay, I gotcha.
[ Clears throat ]

00:00:46.246 --> 00:00:48.915
-The first fact is for Dwayne.
-Yeah.

00:00:48.915 --> 00:00:51.918
-True or false...

00:01:02.228 --> 00:01:04.463 line:0%
-False.
-Wait, wait, wait. Hold on.

00:01:04.463 --> 00:01:05.932 line:0%
You know that?

00:01:09.368 --> 00:01:13.039 line:0%
You think there's -- No,
that's got to be false, right?

00:01:13.039 --> 00:01:14.707 line:0%
-It's false.
-Wait, but -- Wait.

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.909 line:0%
I don't want to be --
I don't want my mind blown.

00:01:16.909 --> 00:01:18.711 line:0%
-Yes, you do.
-Are you sure?

00:01:18.711 --> 00:01:21.014 line:0%
-Yes, you do.
I am absolutely positive.

00:01:21.014 --> 00:01:22.382 line:0%
-All right.
He's locking it in.

00:01:22.382 --> 00:01:23.482 line:0%
-I remember this.
-Okay.

00:01:23.482 --> 00:01:26.152 line:0%
-The answer may surprise you.

00:01:26.152 --> 00:01:28.721 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:33.559 --> 00:01:35.294 line:0%
[ Buzzer ]

00:01:35.294 --> 00:01:38.231 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]
-It's true!

00:01:38.231 --> 00:01:41.534 line:0%
Can we see that again
in slow motion?

00:01:41.534 --> 00:01:43.303
-[ Laughs ]

00:01:43.303 --> 00:01:45.872
[ Laughter ]

00:01:47.940 --> 00:01:49.775
-Wow!
-Nice.

00:01:49.775 --> 00:01:52.211
-There are more stars --

00:01:52.211 --> 00:01:54.213
-The next fact
is for you, Jimmy.

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:55.380
-Okay, yeah, yeah.

00:01:55.380 --> 00:01:58.084 line:0%
If laid out end to end...

00:02:02.621 --> 00:02:05.091 line:0%
-[ Groans ]
-Truth or a lie?

00:02:05.091 --> 00:02:07.026 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:07.026 --> 00:02:09.295 line:0%
No, you could be acting
like it's so obvious.

00:02:09.295 --> 00:02:10.463 line:0%
-Ahh!

00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:11.997 line:0%
-I know, 'cause I think
that it's obvious.

00:02:11.997 --> 00:02:13.900 line:0%
I think I've heard this,
that, yes, it is, the small --

00:02:13.900 --> 00:02:16.168 line:0%
Oh, wait.
Or is it the large intestine?

00:02:16.168 --> 00:02:17.904 line:0%
-Yeah.
-The small intestine.

00:02:17.904 --> 00:02:19.539 line:0%
-I think this is
a trick question.

00:02:19.539 --> 00:02:22.241 line:0%
First of all,
I've never looked cooler.

00:02:22.241 --> 00:02:24.877 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:24.877 --> 00:02:28.214 line:0%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:28.214 --> 00:02:33.285 line:0%
Uh, I think I would say
that is -- that is, uh, true.

00:02:33.285 --> 00:02:35.220 line:0%
It's longer
than a football field.

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:39.225 line:0%
-Is he correct?

00:02:39.225 --> 00:02:41.560 line:0%
-The answer might --

00:02:41.560 --> 00:02:45.064 line:0%
-The answer may surprise you.
-Yeah. There.

00:02:45.064 --> 00:02:47.166 line:0%
Yes.

00:02:47.166 --> 00:02:49.335 line:0%
-Ahh.
-That is a lie.

00:02:49.335 --> 00:02:52.738 line:0%
Let's see that mind blowing
again in slow motion.

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:54.840
-Yeah!
-What the heck was that?!

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.009
-Lettuce in the mouth!

00:02:57.009 --> 00:03:00.612
-Wait. You didn't get lettuce!
Why do I get --

00:03:00.612 --> 00:03:03.315
You got, like, conf--
You got, like, Fruity Pebbles!

00:03:03.315 --> 00:03:06.152
You got Fruity Pebbles.
I got some old salad.

00:03:06.152 --> 00:03:08.421
-I got cotton.
-What the heck was that?

00:03:08.421 --> 00:03:10.790
-There's bacteria on that salad.
-Dwayne.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:12.258
-Oh, my God!

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:13.792
-Dwayne.
-Yes.

00:03:13.792 --> 00:03:15.361
-You're up next.
-All right.

00:03:15.361 --> 00:03:18.064 line:0%
-Fact or fiction?

00:03:26.205 --> 00:03:28.474 line:0%
Truth or false?

00:03:28.474 --> 00:03:30.510 line:0%
-This is a joke.

00:03:32.812 --> 00:03:34.347 line:0%
Look how big my hand is.

00:03:34.347 --> 00:03:36.849 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:43.722 --> 00:03:47.626 line:0%
-That is completely,
unequivocally false.

00:03:47.626 --> 00:03:49.561 line:0%
-Yeah, I agree.

00:03:49.561 --> 00:03:52.298 line:0%
-The answer --
-Answer may surprise you, yeah.

00:03:52.298 --> 00:03:55.168 line:0%
-Yes. The answer
may surprise you.

00:03:55.168 --> 00:03:57.036 line:0%
-Ohh.

00:03:59.172 --> 00:04:02.775 line:0%
-It's true. Can we see that
again in slow motion, please?

00:04:02.775 --> 00:04:05.211
-What'd you get in that?
-That was harder.

00:04:05.211 --> 00:04:08.780
-That was hail.
You got hit with hail.

00:04:08.780 --> 00:04:11.917
Oh, hail, no!
You got hailed.

00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:13.886
-I got hail no.
-All right.

00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:17.690
-This next fact is for Jimmy.
-Wait. Wait.

00:04:17.690 --> 00:04:18.991
-Does that -- Wait.

00:04:18.991 --> 00:04:20.960
So there's only two escalators
in the state of Wyoming?

00:04:20.960 --> 00:04:22.528
-Yeah, apparently.
-Oh, okay.

00:04:22.528 --> 00:04:25.364
-You want to get another --
-No, I'm good, yeah.

00:04:25.364 --> 00:04:27.567
[ Laughter ]

00:04:35.908 --> 00:04:37.343 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:04:37.343 --> 00:04:40.847 line:0%
-Truth or a lie?

00:04:40.847 --> 00:04:42.347 line:0%
-Yeah.

00:04:42.347 --> 00:04:45.651 line:0%
-[ Imitating flushing ]
I'm --

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:47.152 line:0%
Toilet, not urinals, right?

00:04:47.152 --> 00:04:48.988 line:0%
Toilets.
-Toilet.

00:04:48.988 --> 00:04:50.790 line:0%
-[ Imitating flushing ]
Was that E-flat?

00:04:50.790 --> 00:04:52.858 line:0%
♪ You give me that note,
Is that an E-flat? ♪

00:04:52.858 --> 00:04:55.461 line:0%
♪ That's E-flat, yes, it is ♪

00:04:55.461 --> 00:04:56.729 line:0%
-[ Imitating flushing ]

00:04:56.729 --> 00:04:59.232 line:0%
I think, if so,
that's a total coincidence.

00:04:59.232 --> 00:05:02.701 line:0%
I will say
that is absolutely false.

00:05:02.701 --> 00:05:05.238 line:0%
-All right.
-Is he correct?

00:05:08.808 --> 00:05:10.676 line:0%
-Just -- Ohh!

00:05:10.676 --> 00:05:12.578 line:0%
-Yeah! [ Laughs ]

00:05:12.578 --> 00:05:14.513 line:0%
-You were supposed to say --
You were supposed to say,

00:05:14.513 --> 00:05:15.914 line:0%
"The answer may surprise you."

00:05:15.914 --> 00:05:19.418
-Nah. Let's see that mind
blowing again in slow motion.

00:05:19.418 --> 00:05:22.988
-You're supposed to say,
"The answer may surpr--"

00:05:22.988 --> 00:05:25.658
What was that?

00:05:25.658 --> 00:05:28.260
-Yeah!
-I don't know what that was.

00:05:28.260 --> 00:05:30.696
It was like a Ziploc bag
of kidneys or something.

00:05:30.696 --> 00:05:32.197
-[ Laughs ]

00:05:32.197 --> 00:05:35.101
[ Thunder crashes ]

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:37.436
-Excuse me.

00:05:37.436 --> 00:05:40.339
-Oh, yeah. Oh. E-flat.

00:05:40.339 --> 00:05:44.043
-That sound means it's time
for the final question.

00:05:44.043 --> 00:05:46.745
It's a simple
yes-or-no question.

00:05:46.745 --> 00:05:48.847
And it comes with a twist.

00:05:48.847 --> 00:05:51.117
If you answer incorrectly,

00:05:51.117 --> 00:05:53.920
both of your minds
will be blown.

00:05:53.920 --> 00:05:55.655
-Dwayne.
-Okay.

00:05:55.655 --> 00:05:58.725
-The question goes to you.
-Okay.

00:06:02.227 --> 00:06:04.530 line:0%
-Oh, gosh!

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:07.367 line:0%
-[ Laughs ]

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:11.169 line:0%
I know.
I better do the same thing.

00:06:11.169 --> 00:06:13.239 line:0%
-Just do the same --
We're not gonna get this right.

00:06:13.239 --> 00:06:15.808 line:0%
-All right. 'Cause this
is extremely debatable.

00:06:15.808 --> 00:06:17.843 line:0%
-Yeah, I know.
I know. It is. Yeah.

00:06:17.843 --> 00:06:20.980 line:0%
-My answer --
is a hot dog a sandwich?

00:06:22.681 --> 00:06:25.250 line:0%
Yes, it is a sandwich.

00:06:25.250 --> 00:06:26.686 line:0%
[ Audience booing ]

00:06:26.686 --> 00:06:28.988 line:0%
-Oh, boo!
-Are you sure?

00:06:28.988 --> 00:06:31.089 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:31.089 --> 00:06:34.092 line:0%
-A hot dog is a sandwich.

00:06:34.092 --> 00:06:37.363 line:0%
It's got meat and two --
and two pieces of bread!

00:06:39.364 --> 00:06:41.467 line:0%
-Look at you yelling that.

00:06:41.467 --> 00:06:44.236 line:0%
Or debating is -- All right.

00:06:44.236 --> 00:06:47.173 line:0%
-Is the answer correct?

00:06:51.077 --> 00:06:53.479 line:0%
[ Laughter ]

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:57.183 line:0%
-You are wrong.
A hot dog is not a sandwich.

00:06:57.183 --> 00:07:00.886
Let's see the shock again
in slow motion.

00:07:00.886 --> 00:07:04.290
-There you go. Look at this.
Blam! Right there.

00:07:04.290 --> 00:07:07.293
Ooh.
Got a little mustache there.

00:07:07.293 --> 00:07:09.695
I had, like, a --
"Time to make the doughnuts."

00:07:09.695 --> 00:07:12.899
-You look so cool.
-Thank you. You too.

00:07:12.899 --> 00:07:14.833
Dwayne Johnson
is the winner, everybody!

00:07:14.833 --> 00:07:16.268
Come on! The champ!

00:07:16.268 --> 00:07:19.104
Check him out hosting "Saturday
Night Live" this weekend.

00:07:19.104 --> 00:07:21.206
Ellie Kemper
joins us after the break.

00:07:21.206 --> 00:07:23.075
Stick around, everybody!

00:07:23.075 --> 00:07:25.177
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:07:25.177 --> 00:07:28.381
♪♪

